{number: 17}
{title: Love Divine, All Love Excelling}
{key: Bb}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Bb] Love divine, all [Eb] loves ex-[Bb] celling,
[Eb] Joy of [Bb] heaven, to [F7] earth come [Bb] down;
[Bb] Fix in us Thy [Eb] humble [Bb] dwelling,
[Eb] All Thy [Bb] faithful [F7] mercies [Bb] crown.
[F] Jesus, [Bb] Thou art [F] all com-[Bb] passion,
[Eb] Pure, un-[Bb] bounded [C7] love Thou [F] art;
[Bb] Visit us with [Eb] Thy sal-[Bb] vation,
[Eb] Enter [Bb] every [F7] trembling [Bb] heart.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Bb] Breathe, O breathe Thy [Eb] loving [Bb] Spirit
[Eb] Into [Bb] every [F7] troubled [Bb] breast!
[Bb] Let us all in [Eb] Thee in-[Bb] herit,
[Eb] Let us [Bb] find that [F7] second [Bb] rest.
[F] Take a-[Bb] way the [F] love of [Bb] sinning,
[Eb] Alpha [Bb] and O-[C7] mega [F] be;
[Bb] End of faith, as [Eb] its be-[Bb] ginning,
[Eb] Set our [Bb] hearts at [F7] liber-[Bb] ty.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[Bb] Come, Almighty [Eb] to de-[Bb] liver,
[Eb] Let us [Bb] all Thy [F7] life re-[Bb] ceive;
[Bb] Suddenly re-[Eb] turn, and [Bb] never,
[Eb] Never-[Bb] more Thy [F7] temples [Bb] leave:
[F] Thee we [Bb] would be [F] always [Bb] blessing,
[Eb] Serve Thee [Bb] as Thy [C7] hosts a-[F] bove,
[Bb] Pray, and praise Thee [Eb] without [Bb] ceasing,
[Eb] Glory [Bb] in Thy [F7] perfect [Bb] love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[Bb] Finish then Thy [Eb] new cre-[Bb] ation,
[Eb] Pure and [Bb] spotless [F7] let us [Bb] be;
[Bb] Let us see Thy [Eb] great sal-[Bb] vation
[Eb] Perfectly [Bb] re-[F7] stored in [Bb] Thee:
[F] Changed from [Bb] glory [F] into [Bb] glory,
[Eb] Till in [Bb] heaven we [C7] take our [F] place,
[Bb] Till we cast our [Eb] crowns be-[Bb] fore Thee,
[Eb] Lost in [Bb] wonder, [F7] love, and [Bb] praise.
{end_of_verse}
